Focus on the long-term fundamental growth prospects of the S&P 500 companies. Examine the investments that companies are making to be able to sustain themselves in the market. Evaluate their research and development, investment into employees. Focus on technological companies, as those are the biggest weight of the S&P 500. Are these companies focusing on short-term gains, or sustainability in the market. This will be an appropriate guide as to your sentiment, adjusted based on your confidence.